# JudeanFloraV1; canonical UE cm (X east, +Y south, Z up), written with Y reflected and triangle winding reversed for the legacy OBJ importer adapter. One o object, no g groups, so the importer creates exactly one material slot.
# thorny burnet far-distance impostor; ONE open single-sided quad, drawn by a camera-facing material. Deliberately exempt from the closed-shell and signed-volume checks.
o SM_JudeanFloraV1_ThornyBurnet_Billboard
s off
v -32.50000 -0.00000 0.00000
v 32.50000 -0.00000 0.00000
v 32.50000 -0.00000 45.00000
v -32.50000 -0.00000 45.00000
vt 0.00000 1.00000
vt 1.00000 1.00000
vt 1.00000 0.00000
vt 0.00000 0.00000
vn 0.0000 1.0000 0.0000
f 1/1/1 3/3/1 2/2/1
f 1/1/1 4/4/1 3/3/1
